# oc-sim scenario v1
# From the app menu, open SETUP, walk the left encoder down to CALIBRATE and
# start the wizard; step past "start fresh?" to the low point of output A
# and turn the right encoder up three detents: every output sits at -3 V and
# the screen shows the DAC code being trimmed (journal/D-026, D-027).
ticks 260
20  button up down
20  button down down
40  button up up
40  button down up
60  button up down
66  button up up
90  button right down
96  button right up
120 encoder 1 +6
140 button right down
146 button right up
170 button down down
176 button down up
220 encoder 2 +3
